---
description: Thin pointer to the AnomalyOS engineering contract. Do not duplicate AGENTS.md.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before non-trivial changes. It is the contract.

- Do not silently violate an invariant in `docs/INVARIANTS.md`. Name it and stop.
- Build only the stage you were asked for (`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` stage status, `docs/tasks/`).
- Jev decides. Code routes. LLM explains. Agent investigates.
- After code changes: harness tests, `python scripts/check_architecture.py`, `python scripts/eval_smoke.py`; product tests with `pytest`.
- No new dependencies without an ADR in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
